.583.8700 – 619.220.TIXS. Tickets are also available at <STRONG><A href="http://www.ticketmaster.com" target=_blank>www.ticketmaster.com</A></STRONG>. <br><br><b>Note:</b> <i>Special thanks to our member <STRONG>Kramm</STRONG>. Source: <STRONG>Clear 
