<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000"><P>New York Post</P>
<P>4/2/04</P>
<P><STRONG>MADONNA'S</STRONG> "re-Invention" tour sold out instantly around the world. (Madison Square Garden added four more shows, as the first two vanished in a puff of smoke.) She can be a married quasi-British matron; a mother of two; a children's book author; a devotee of the Kaballah; and even make a record not everybody's crazy about. But just put out the word that she'll appear onstage, and it's 1984 all over again. She's still the queen. 
