<font class="content">Written by <a href="">newyorkcityboy</a> on Friday, April 02 @  W. Europe Daylight Time  [1 reads].</font><br>
<font class="content"">(<a href="modules.php?name=News&amp;file=article&amp;sid=2072">comments?</a> | Score: 0)</font>

