</td></tr></table></td></tr></table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">As you well know, <STRONG>Madonna</STRONG> has announced another <STRONG>London</STRONG> date to her <STRONG>"re-INVENTION TOUR."</STRONG> After soldout night at <STRONG>Earl's Court</STRONG> on <STRONG>August 18 and 19</STRONG>, she will play <STRONG>Wembley Arena</STRONG> on <STRONG>August 22</STRONG>. <BR><BR>Tickets goes on sale today, <STRONG>April 2</STRONG> at <STRONG>9:00am</STRONG>. You can buy tickets&nbsp;via <STRONG><A href="http://www.ticketmaster.co.uk" target=_blank>TicketMaster.co.uk</A></STRONG> and <STRONG><A href="http://www.ticketzone.co.uk" target=_blank>TicketZone.co.uk</A></STRONG>. No doubt this venue will be sold out very quickly. After two days of <STRONG>Paris</STRONG> tickets fever, now <STRONG>London</STRONG> turn is coming again! <BR><BR>Don't forget that new dates at <STRONG>Wembley Arena</STRONG> could be added and announced today, with tickets going on sale after the first one sold out. So, look out! 
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


