<table border="0" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" width="100%"><tr><td>
<a href="modules.php?name=News&new_topic=20"><img src="images/topics/live.gif" border="0" Alt="Live" align="right" hspace="10" vspace="10"></a>
<div align=justify><font class="posted" color="#000000">According to<STRONG> Europa Press</STRONG> and<STRONG> Yahoo Noticias,</STRONG><BR><BR><STRONG>Madonna " will perform this summer in Madrid and Barcelona, as part of the world tour that the singer will initiate on May 24th in Los Angeles to present her last work 'American Life' (Warner). By time, the dates of the concerts are about to be confirmed but it seems that Madonna would be able to act in Madrid and Barcelona by the end of August or beginning of September. </STRONG><BR><BR><STRONG>The European tour of Madonna, 'Invention World Tour 2004', will begin on the 18th of August in London, where the singer will give six concerts. On August 28th she will travel to Dublin (Ireland) and September 1st will arrive at Paris, as reported from sources of the business European Events.</STRONG> 
</font></div>
</td></tr></table>


</td></tr></table>


